#: index.php:111
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Bersyon"

#: index.php:144 index.php:286
msgid "Create bootable USB drives the easy way"
msgstr "Gumawa ng mga bootable USB drive sa madaling paraan"

#: index.php:230
msgid "Change language:"
msgstr "Baguhin and wika"

#: index.php:239
msgid "Want to improve this translation?"
msgstr "Gusto mong pagbutihin ang pagsasaling ito?"

#: index.php:313
msgid ""
"Rufus is a utility that helps format and create bootable USB flash drives, "
"such as USB keys/pendrives, memory sticks, etc."
msgstr ""
"Ang Rufus ay isang utility na tumutulong sa pag-format at paggawa ng mga "
"bootable USB flash drive, tulad ng mga USB key/pendrive, memory stick, atbp."

#: index.php:314
msgid "It can be especially useful for cases where:"
msgstr ""
"Maaari itong maging kapaki-pakinabang lalo na para sa mga kaso kung saan:"

#: index.php:316
msgid ""
"you need to create USB installation media from bootable ISOs (Windows, "
"Linux, UEFI, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"kailangan mong lumikha ng USB installation media mula sa mga bootable na ISO"
" (Windows, Linux, UEFI, atbp.)"

#: index.php:317
msgid "you need to work on a system that doesn't have an OS installed"
msgstr ""
"kailangan mong magtrabaho sa isang system na walang OS na naka-install"

#: index.php:318
msgid "you need to flash a BIOS or other firmware from DOS"
msgstr "kailangan mong mag-flash ng BIOS o iba pang firmware mula sa DOS"

#: index.php:319
msgid "you want to run a low-level utility"
msgstr "gusto mong magpatakbo ng mababang antas ng utility"

#: index.php:321
msgid "Despite its small size, Rufus provides everything you need!"
msgstr ""
"Sa kabila ng maliit na sukat nito, ibinibigay ni Rufus ang lahat ng "
"kailangan mo!"

#: index.php:322
msgid ""
"A non exhaustive list of Rufus supported ISOs is also provided at the bottom"
" of this page."
msgstr ""
"Ang isang hindi kumpletong listahan ng mga ISO na sinusuportahan ng Rufus ay"
" ibinibigay din sa ibaba ng pahinang ito."

