msgid "Other versions"
msgstr "Iba pang mga bersyon"

#: index.php:378
msgid "System Requirements:"
msgstr "Mga Kinakailangan sa System"

#: index.php:379
msgid "Windows 8 or later."
msgstr "Windows 8 o mas bago."

#: index.php:379
msgid "Once downloaded, the application is ready to use."
msgstr "Kapag na-download na, handa nang gamitin ang application."

#: index.php:380
msgid "Supported Languages:"
msgstr "Mga Sinusuportahang Wika:"

#: index.php:426
msgid ""
"I will take this opportunity to express my gratitude to the translators who "
"made it possible for Rufus, as well as this webpage, to be translated in "
"various languages. If you find that you can use Rufus in your own language, "
"you should really thank them!"
msgstr ""
"Sasamantalahin ko ang pagkakataong ito para ipahayag ang aking pasasalamat "
"sa mga tagapagsalin na nagbigay-daan sa Rufus, gayundin sa webpage na ito, "
"na maisalin sa iba't ibang wika. Kung nalaman mong magagamit mo si Rufus sa "
"iyong sariling wika, dapat mo silang pasalamatan!"

#: index.php:277 index.php:429
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Paggamit"

#: index.php:430
msgid ""
"Download the executable and run it &ndash; no installation is necessary."
msgstr ""
"I-download ang executable at patakbuhin ito &ndash; walang kinakailangang "
"pag-install."

#: index.php:431
msgid "The executable is digitally signed and the signature should state:"
msgstr ""
"Ang executable ay digital na nilagdaan at ang pirma ay dapat na nakasaad:"

#: index.php:433
msgid "(v1.3.0 or later)"
msgstr "(v1.3.0 o mas bago)"

#: index.php:434
msgid "(v1.2.0 or earlier)"
msgstr "(v1.2.0 o mas maaga)"

#: index.php:436
msgid "Notes on DOS support:"
msgstr "Mga tala sa suporta ng DOS:"

#: index.php:437
msgid ""
"If you create a DOS bootable drive and use a non-US keyboard, Rufus will "
"attempt to select a keyboard layout according to the locale of your system."
msgstr ""
"Kung gagawa ka ng DOS bootable drive at gumamit ng non-US na keyboard, "
"susubukan ni Rufus na pumili ng layout ng keyboard ayon sa locale ng iyong "
"system."

#: index.php:438
msgid "Notes on ISO Support:"
msgstr "Mga Tala sa Suporta sa ISO:"

#: index.php:439
#, php-format
msgid ""
"All versions of Rufus since v1.1.0 allow the creation of a bootable USB from"
" an <a target=\"_blank\" %s>ISO image</a> (.iso)."
msgstr ""
"Ang lahat ng bersyon ng Rufus mula noong v1.1.0 ay nagbibigay-daan sa "
"paglikha ng isang bootable USB mula sa isang <a target=\"_blank\" %s>ISO "
"image</a>(.iso)."

#: index.php:440
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Creating an ISO image from a physical disc or from a set of files is very "
"easy to do however, through the use of a CD burning application, such as the"
" freely available <a target=\"_blank\" %s>InfraRecorder</a> or <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>CDBurnerXP</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ang paglikha ng isang ISO na imahe mula sa isang pisikal na disc o mula sa "
"isang hanay ng mga file ay napakadaling gawin gayunpaman, sa pamamagitan ng "
"paggamit ng isang CD burning application, tulad ng malayang magagamit na <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>InfraRecorder</a> o <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>CDBurnerXP</a>."

#: index.php:443
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)"
msgstr "Mga Madalas Itanong (FAQ)"

#. You are encouraged to add the translation for " (in English)." after
#. "HERE</a></b>" as the FAQ is only available in English
#: index.php:444
#, php-format
msgid "A Rufus FAQ is available <b><a target=\"_blank\" %s>HERE</a></b>."
msgstr "Available ang isang Rufus FAQ <b><a target=\"_blank\" %s>DITO</a></b>."

#: index.php:445
#, php-format
msgid ""
"To provide feedback, report a bug or request an enhancement, please use the "
"GitHub <a target=\"_blank\" %s>issue tracker</a>. Or you can <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>send an e-mail</a>."
msgstr ""
"Upang magbigay ng feedback, mag-ulat ng bug o humiling ng pagpapahusay, "
"mangyaring gamitin ang GitHub <a target=\"_blank\" %s>issue tracker</a>. O "
"maaari kang <a target=\"_blank\" %s>magpadala ng e-mail</a>."

#: index.php:448
msgid "License"
msgstr "Lisensya"

#: index.php:449
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<a target=\"_blank\" %s>GNU General Public License (GPL) version 3</a> or "
"later."
msgstr ""
"<a target=\"_blank\" %s>GNU General Public License (GPL) bersyon 3</a> o mas"
" bago."

#: index.php:449
msgid ""
"You are free to distribute, modify or even sell the software, insofar as you"
" respect the GPLv3 license."
msgstr ""
"Malaya kang ipamahagi, baguhin o ibenta ang software, hangga't iginagalang "
"mo ang lisensya ng GPLv3."

#: index.php:450
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Rufus is produced in a 100%% transparent manner, from its <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>public source</a>, using a <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>MinGW32</a> environment."
msgstr ""
"Ang Rufus ay ginawa sa 100%% transparent na paraan, mula sa <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>pampublikong source</a> nito, gamit ang isang <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>MinGW32</a> na kapaligiran."

#. You are encouraged to append the translation for "(in English)" after
#. "Changelog" as it is only available in English
#: index.php:453
msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "Changelog"

#: index.php:279 index.php:485
msgid "Source Code"
msgstr "Source Code"

#: index.php:487
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can clone the <a target=\"_blank\" %s>git</a> repository "
"using:"
msgstr ""
"Bilang kahalili, maaari mong i-clone ang <a target=\"_blank\" %s>git</a> "
"repository gamit ang:"

#: index.php:489
#, php-format
msgid "For more information, see the <a target=\"_blank\" %s>GitHub project</a>."
msgstr ""
"Para sa higit pang impormasyon, tingnan ang <a target=\"_blank\" %s>GitHub "
"project</a>."

#: index.php:490
msgid ""
"If you are a developer, you are very much encouraged to tinker with Rufus "
"and submit patches."
msgstr ""
"Kung ikaw ay isang developer, labis kang hinihikayat na makipag-usap sa "
"Rufus at magsumite ng mga patch."

#: index.php:280 index.php:493
msgid "Donations"
msgstr "Mga donasyon"

#: index.php:494
msgid ""
"Since I'm getting asked about this on regular basis, there is <b>no</b> "
"donation button on this page."
msgstr ""
"Dahil palagi akong tinatanong tungkol dito, <b>walang</b> button ng donasyon"
" sa page na ito."

#: index.php:495
msgid ""
"The main reason is that I feel that the donation system doesn't actually "
"help software development and worse, can be guilt-inducing for users who "
"choose not to donate."
msgstr ""
"Ang pangunahing dahilan ay ang pakiramdam ko na ang sistema ng donasyon ay "
"hindi talaga nakakatulong sa pagbuo ng software at ang mas malala pa, ay "
"maaaring maging sanhi ng pagkakasala para sa mga user na pipili na huwag "
"mag-donate."

#: index.php:498
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If you really insist, you can always make a donation to the <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>Free Software Foundation</a>, as they are the main "
"reason software like Rufus is possible."
msgstr ""
"Kung talagang pipilitin mo, maaari kang magbigay ng donasyon anumang oras sa"
" <a target=\"_blank\" %s>Free Software Foundation</a>, dahil sila ang "
"pangunahing dahilan kung bakit posible ang software tulad ni Rufus."

#: index.php:499
msgid ""
"At any rate, I'll take this opportunity to say <i><u>thank you</u></i> for "
"your continuing support and enthusiasm about this little program: it is much"
" appreciated!"
msgstr ""
"Sa anumang kaso, gagamitin ko ang pagkakataong ito para sabihin "
"<i><u>salamat</u></i> para sa iyong patuloy na suporta at sigasig tungkol sa"
" maliit na programang ito: ito ay lubos na pinahahalagahan!"

#: index.php:500
msgid ""
"But please continue to feel free to use Rufus without any guilt about not "
"contributing for it financially &ndash; you should never have to!"
msgstr ""
"Ngunit mangyaring patuloy na huwag mag-atubiling gamitin si Rufus nang "
"walang anumang pagkakasala tungkol sa hindi pag-aambag para dito sa "
"pananalapi &ndash; hindi mo dapat kailanganin!"

#: index.php:503
msgid "Non exhaustive list of ISOs Rufus is known to work with"
msgstr "Hindi kumpletong listahan ng mga ISO na kilala ni Rufus"

